# Backend — Spring Boot

- Thin controllers; business logic in services; DTO boundaries (no JPA entities in API responses).
- 201 + `Location` on create; centralized `@RestControllerAdvice` error envelope.
- Flyway (or equivalent) forward-only migrations; no `ddl-auto` in non-local profiles.
- Parameterized queries / JPA only — no concatenated SQL.
- Tests run with the project's Java toolchain; do not skip JaCoCo check.
- Honor `java_master_templates` hybrid_policy: templates own layering, CRUD signatures, and the error envelope. Persist `artifacts/templates/<resource>-vars.yaml`. `tools/templates/render_check.py` must PASS before DoD.
- Cited domain logic only in service `AGENT-OWNED DOMAIN` markers, a `ValidationRule`, or a new cited type. Never rewrite controller style.
